xtras/9f713a1f4b0e8077d62d9581ac68730b.mp4?t=1749860592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>As you progress, unlock new tools, and equipment, enhancing your efficiency and effectiveness as a pool cleaner extraordinaire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing Gameplay</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165620/extras/2d9d46e38e593e41483cadaee3b2aec3.poster.avif?t=1749860592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165620/extras/2d9d46e38e593e41483cadaee3b2aec3.webm?t=1749860592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165620/extras/2d9d46e38e593e41483cadaee3b2aec3.mp4?t=1749860592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Enjoy a soothing gameplay experience that combines meditative interactions with a sense of accomplishment as you witness the transformation of dirty pools into pristine retreats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Early Access participants will have the unique opportunity to shape the future development of Pool Cleaning Simulator through their feedback and suggestions. We (Rubens Games) are committed to working closely with the community to refine the gameplay, introduce new features, and ensure a polished and enjoyable final release. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165620/extras/458f1708827da7586c4d2243891a5bb9.avif?t=1749860592\" /></div></p>",
